{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00849","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 武功舞歌二首 一 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋昭德成功舞歌 武功舞歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拨乱资英主，开基自晋阳。\n一戎成大业，七德焕前王。\n炎汉提封远，姬周世祚长。\n朱干将玉戚，全象武功扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}